  "html": "<p>這次的活動共有 113 位師生、校友以及親朋好友的熱情參與，包含執行長、副執行長、師長以及 104 屆至 112 屆的各屆學長姐們。謝謝 EMRD 校友會舉辦這次溫馨難忘的烤肉活動，同時也衷心感謝 109 屆的 Arthur 學長和 Bill 學長的主辦，讓這時隔四年的活動得以在疫情後再次舉行。期待明年大家的相聚，共創更多美好的回憶！</p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/2XLKfWAItSM\" title=\"EMRD 112 學年度迎新送舊烤肉會\"></iframe></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"450\" src=\"/legacy/img/e37357d149-3-1-s.jpg\" width=\"800\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"450\" src=\"/legacy/img/ebf435386c-4-1-s.jpg\" width=\"800\"></p>\n<p>合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"450\" src=\"/legacy/img/17e92e1927-8-1-s.jpg\" width=\"800\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"640\" src=\"/legacy/img/57a39cac27-1-1-s.jpg\" width=\"480\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"640\" src=\"/legacy/img/467018736b-6-1-s.jpg\" width=\"360\"></p>\n<p>空拍合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;空拍合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/5f75d95071-689233941.jpg\" width=\"373\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/2b06199ba9-730895269.jpg\" width=\"498\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>EMRD 游進陽執行長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 鄭逸琳副執行長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/743986429b-220313712.jpg\" width=\"498\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/3fe21e7a19-750597728.jpg\" width=\"373\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 蔡孟霖班導師致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 王煥權班代致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"251\" src=\"/legacy/img/ceb76c9147-491139558.jpg\" width=\"188\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"250\" src=\"/legacy/img/5e68d01678-796219028.jpg\" width=\"333\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"250\" src=\"/legacy/img/0b1d5f4f0c-650929795.jpg\" width=\"333\"></p>\n<p>SEMI-EMRD&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 吳欽文校友會理事長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 李定為校友會副理事長致詞&nbsp;</p>\n<p>周碩康班代致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/e8b13953ae-803520543.jpg\" width=\"498\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/b0eeb09d89-873274772.jpg\" width=\"373\"></p>\n<p>活動嘉賓&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 會場</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"320\" src=\"/legacy/img/587c92fa68-794575328.jpg\" width=\"427\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"320\" src=\"/legacy/img/62d0580b77-854755517.jpg\" width=\"427\"></p>\n<p>會場&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;會旗</p>",
